CloudBurrow patch to LiteRT-LM 0082833d (#2107): a decode step observer.

At each decode step that samples outside the executor (the CPU external
sampler), the observer is told the chosen token and the top-k tokens, each
with the log-softmax of the logits the model produced for that step, read
before any decoding constraint masks them. cloudburrow_generate uses it to
answer Vertex AI's responseLogprobs (logprobsResult.chosenCandidates) and
logprobs (logprobsResult.topCandidates).

